1. Remove the clean water tank, open the dust bag cover, check if the dust bag is installed, and ensure that the dust bag is properly installed; remove the dust bag, check if the dust port is blocked, and manually clean it if blocked;

https://d3pkbgk01oouhl.cloudfront.net/upload_file/prod/check-the-dust-bag-and-dust-collection-port.png

2. Remove the robot's magnetic cover, remove the robot's dust bin, check if the robot's dust bin is full or if the dust inlet is blocked by foreign objects. If blocked, please clean manually;

https://d3pkbgk01oouhl.cloudfront.net/upload_file/prod/dust-bin.png

https://d3pkbgk01oouhl.cloudfront.net/upload_file/prod/filter-of-dust-bin.png

3. Check if the base station dust inlet is blocked by foreign objects. If so, please manually clean it;

https://d3pkbgk01oouhl.cloudfront.net/upload_file/prod/dust-collection-port-of-station.png

4. Remove the base station's clean water tank and dirty water tank, flip the base station upside down, unscrew the two screws on the transparent cover, and remove the white rubber plug to check if the dust collection channel is blocked by foreign objects.

https://d3pkbgk01oouhl.cloudfront.net/upload_file/prod/bottom-channel-of-station.png
